s a crystal clear message, and the road ahead is super clear. Ethereum is untouchable.\\\\\\\"\\\"]}]\\n9f:[\\\"$\\\",\\\"p\\\",\\\"fabd87cb9b92\\\",{\\\"children\\\":[\\\"Developer Suhail Kakar also \\\",[\\\"$\\\",\\\"a\\\",\\\"0fb9b9ffb9a2\\\",{\\\"href\\\":\\\"https://x.com/SuhailKakar/status/2058595040491192406\\\",\\\"target\\\":\\\"_blank\\\",\\\"rel\\\":\\\"noopener noreferrer\\\",\\\"children\\\":[\\\"replied directly\\\"]}],\\\", calling the post \\\\\\\"bullish.\\\\\\\" \\\\\\\"A foundation voluntarily shrinking its own power is the rarest thing in crypto. genuinely the most cypherpunk thing I've read in a long time.\\\\\\\"\\\"]}]\\na0:[\\\"$\\\",\\\"p\\\",\\\"de62dfe86e00\\\",{\\\"children\\\":[\\\"Meanwhile, core developers picked at the CROPS framework. \\\"]}]\\na1:[\\\"$\\\",\\\"$L9c\\\",\\\"f8b0afef\\\",{\\\"index\\\":1,\\\"media\\\":\\\"desktop\\\",\\\"isPremium\\\":false}]\\na2:[\\\"$\\\",\\\"p\\\",\\\"1489d7534ed7\\\",{\\\"children\\\":[\\\"Go-Ethereum developer Marius van der Wijden \\\",[\\\"$\\\",\\\"a\\\",\\\"845b2cd5a1d6\\\",{\\\"href\\\":\\\"https://x.com/vdWijden/status/2058655368700371052\\\",\\\"target\\\":\\\"_blank\\\",\\\"rel\\\":\\\"noopener noreferrer\\\",\\\"children\\\":[\\\"replied\\\"]}],\\\" that security was being underdiscussed: \\\\\\\"When people talk about CROPS, they seem to focus on the CR, OS and Privacy part. The security part is in my opinion the most important! Without a secure L1 none of this makes any sense and we have taken Ethereum's base layer security for granted by now.\\\\\\\"\\\"]}]\\na3:[\\\"$\\\",\\\"p\\\",\\\"58da751f0353\\\",{\\\"children\\\":[\\\"Consensus layer developer Potuz followed up \\\",[\\\"$\\\",\\\"a\\\",\\\"b2c7e97353d9\\\",{\\\"href\\\":\\\"https://x.com/potuz_eth/status/2058866499889103242\\\",\\\"target\\\":\\\"_blank\\\",\\\"rel\\\":\\\"noopener noreferrer\\\",\\\"children\\\":[\\\"in the thread\\\"]}],\\\", noting that \\\\\\\"one of Ethereum's biggest selling points is the no downtime